  m_Text: 'Click a white square (Tower Spot) to buy a tower (Tower Buy Button). Press
    T to carry a free tower, then click to drop it (Tower Placer).

    Red cannons
    (Click Fire Tower) all fire where you click. Click a grey cannon (Select Fire
    Tower) to pick it, then click where it fires.

    The troop (Troop Gold) earns
    1 Gold per unit it walks. 10 enemies are coming. Don''t let 5 reach the flag.'
